"uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":81943750,"digest":"sha256:d4fc63f09bd14ee2308c05d34c231a8d09c3e945fd2e86ef4ea1a41b31dd1830","download_count":7,"created_at":"2026-11-17T07:01:01Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:01:05Z"},{"id":758001732,"node_id":"RA_kwDOOiiGL84tLjBE","name":"opencode-windows-x64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":81943749,"digest":"sha256:fa31c9ec0bac7611ab12699ef8e2fc4c173fb95ac977b09b189b255b8f559bcc","download_count":115,"created_at":"2026-11-17T07:01:00Z","updated_at":"2026-11-17T07:01:06Z"}],"body":"## Desktop\n\n### Improvements\n- OpenCode 1 now offers the upgrade to OpenCode 2.0. OpenCode 2 downloads in the background and installs only when you choose: Restart to upgrade, Upgrade on quit, or Later. Your sessions, projects, and settings are kept. Plugins made for OpenCode 1 need an update.\n\n## Core\n\n### Bugfixes\n- Sessions with many images no longer send oversized requests. When the images in a session's history pass 25 MiB, the oldest are replaced with a placeholder.\n- A provider error for a request body that is too large now starts compaction and a retry instead of failing the turn.","reactions":{"total_count":3,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0}}
